<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 10.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 10.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	May 10	May 09   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  270.500     270.710     247.020    9.51 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  310.520     309.780     306.830    1.20 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.930     159.260     158.970    0.60 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.434	47.196	47.182    0.53 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  437.600     439.060     419.180    4.39 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.170     141.605     141.685    0.34 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.120	16.097	16.185   -0.40 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  228.000     222.070     212.430    7.33 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.891	 1.886	 1.888    0.16 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.587	 1.582	 1.581    0.38 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.655     188.715     183.135    3.56 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
